why the invisibility shouldn't expand to the grease layer, since it's not
just some cloaking material covering you up like the camouflage screens on
Bond's car in "Die Another Day" (now _that_ was illogical. Logic is much
less of a problem when the stuff you invent works by magic, not technology).


